	"nodes":[
		{"id":"bbab72e450282e3c","type":"group","x":-1060,"y":-1340,"width":4411,"height":1960,"label":"Text To Speech"},
		{"id":"d72ac45196658fe8","type":"text","text":"```mermaid\n\nsequenceDiagram\n\n    participant Frontend\n\n    participant Clerk\n\n    participant Polar\n\n    participant MusicMetadata\n\n    participant Prisma\n\n    participant R2\n\n  \n\n    Frontend->>+Backend: POST /api/voices/create<br/>FormData + QueryParams\n\n  \n\n    Backend->>+Clerk: auth()\n\n    Clerk-->>-Backend: { userId, orgId }\n\n  \n\n    alt 未认证\n\n        Backend-->>Frontend: 401 Unauthorized\n\n    else 有认证\n\n        Backend->>+Polar: customers.getStateExternal(orgId)\n\n        Polar-->>-Backend: { activeSubscriptions }\n\n  \n\n        alt 无订阅\n\n            Backend-->>Frontend: 403 SUBSCRIPTION_REQUIRED\n\n        else 有订阅\n\n            Backend->>MusicMetadata: parseBuffer(audioBuffer)\n\n  \n\n            alt 无效音频格式\n\n                Backend-->>Frontend: 422 Invalid audio file\n\n            else 有效格式\n\n                MusicMetadata-->>Backend: { duration }\n\n  \n\n                alt 时长 < 10秒\n\n                    Backend-->>Frontend: 422 Audio too short\n\n                else 时长 >= 10秒\n\n                    Backend->>+Prisma: voice.create()\n\n                    Prisma-->>-Backend: { id }\n\n  \n\n                    Backend->>+R2: uploadAudio(buffer, key)\n\n                    R2-->>-Backend: success\n\n  \n\n                    Backend->>Prisma: voice.update(r2ObjectKey)\n\n  \n\n                    Backend->>Polar: events.ingest(voice_creation)\n\n  \n\n                    Backend-->>Frontend: 201 Voice created\n\n                end\n\n            end\n\n        end\n\n    end\n\n```","x":-3628,"y":1080,"width":1543,"height":1561},
		{"id":"27e3156e31e197f4","type":"text","text":"```mermaid\n\njourney\n\n    title 声音克隆完整用户流程\n\n  \n\n    section 创建自定义语音\n\n        0. 进入 Voices 页面: 5: User\n\n        1. 点击 Create Voice: 5: User\n\n        2. 上传音频文件: 5: User\n\n        3. 填写语音名称: 5: User\n\n        4. 选择语音分类: 5: User\n\n        5. 选择语言: 5: User\n\n        6. 提交创建: 5: User\n\n        7. 等待处理: 5: System\n\n        8. 看到成功提示: 5: User\n\n  \n\n    section 使用语音生成\n\n        9. 进入 Text-to-Speech 页面: 5: User\n\n        10. 输入要转换的文本: 5: User\n\n        11. 选择已创建的语音: 5: User\n\n        12. 调节生成参数: 5: User\n\n        13. 点击 Generate: 5: User\n\n        14. 等待 TTS 生成: 5: System\n\n        15. 播放生成的音频: 5: User\n\n        16. 下载音频文件: 5: User\n\n```","x":-1360,"y":3420,"width":3396,"height":616},
		{"id":"87066e08c2f18537","type":"text","text":"```mermaid\n\nflowchart TB\n\n    subgraph 用户操作层\n\n        A[用户进入 Voices 页面]\n\n        B[点击 Create Voice 按钮]\n\n        C[打开语音创建对话框]\n\n    end\n\n  \n\n    subgraph 音频输入层\n\n        D[选择音频输入方式]\n\n        D1[文件上传] --> D\n\n        D2[麦克风录制] --> D\n\n    end\n\n  \n\n    subgraph 元数据填写\n\n        E[填写语音信息]\n\n        E1[语音名称]\n\n        E2[语音分类]\n\n        E3[语言选择]\n\n        E4[语音描述]\n\n    end\n\n  \n\n    subgraph 前端验证\n\n        F[前端表单验证]\n\n        F1[文件格式验证<br/>audio/*]\n\n        F2[文件大小验证<br/>≤20MB]\n\n        F3[必填项检查]\n\n    end\n\n  \n\n    subgraph 后端处理\n\n        G[POST /api/voices/create]\n\n        G1[认证检查<br/>Clerk]\n\n        G2[订阅检查<br/>Polar]\n\n        G3[参数验证<br/>Zod]\n\n        G4[音频格式验证<br/>music-metadata]\n\n        G5[音频时长验证<br/>≥10秒]\n\n    end\n\n  \n\n    subgraph 数据持久化\n\n        H[(Prisma DB<br/>Voice 表)]\n\n        I[(Cloudflare R2<br/>音频存储)]\n\n        J[(Polar<br/>用量事件)]\n\n    end\n\n  \n\n    A --> B --> C --> D\n\n    D --> E\n\n    E --> F\n\n    F --> F1 & F2 & F3\n\n    F --> G\n\n    G --> G1 & G2 & G3 & G4 & G5\n\n    G1 --> H\n\n    G4 --> I\n\n    G5 --> H\n\n    H --> J\n\n  \n\n    style A fill:#e1f5fe\n\n    style G fill:#fff3e0\n\n    style H fill:#e8f5e9\n\n    style I fill:#e8f5e9\n\n```","x":-1360,"y":4320,"width":2108,"height":1480},
		{"id":"333e0812822cfd4a","type":"text","text":"```mermaid\n\nflowchart TB\n\n    subgraph 输入层\n\n        A[用户输入文本]\n\n        B[选择语音]\n\n        C[调节生成参数]\n\n    end\n\n  \n\n    subgraph 前端验证\n\n        D[Zod 表单验证]\n\n        D1[text: 非空]\n\n        D2[voiceId: 非空]\n\n        D3[参数范围检查]\n\n    end\n\n  \n\n    subgraph tRPC 中间层\n\n        E[POST /api/trpc/generations.create]\n\n        E1[SentryMiddleware<br/>日志记录]\n\n        E2[orgProcedure<br/>认证+orgId]\n\n        E3[Zod Input Validation]\n\n    end\n\n  \n\n    subgraph 业务逻辑层\n\n        F[订阅状态检查<br/>Polar]\n\n        G[查询语音信息<br/>Prisma]\n\n        H[调用 Chatterbox API]\n\n    end\n\n  \n\n    subgraph 存储层\n\n        I[(Generation 表<br/>Prisma)]\n\n        J[(R2 存储<br/>生成的音频)]\n\n    end\n\n  \n\n    subgraph 外部服务\n\n        K[(Chatterbox<br/>Modal GPU)]\n\n        L[(Polar<br/>用量上报)]\n\n    end\n\n  \n\n    A & B & C --> D\n\n    D --> D1 & D2 & D3\n\n    D --> E\n\n    E --> E1 & E2 & E3\n\n    E3 --> F\n\n    F --> G\n\n    G --> H\n\n    H --> K\n\n    K --> H\n\n    H --> I & J\n\n    I --> L\n\n  \n\n    style A fill:#e1f5fe\n\n    style K fill:#fff3e0\n\n    style J fill:#e8f5e9\n\n```","x":1760,"y":-1320,"width":1571,"height":1457},
		{"id":"0ae43333f9e0e0bb","type":"text","text":"``` mermaid\nsequenceDiagram\n    participant User as 用户\n    participant Form as TextToSpeechForm\n    participant tRPC as tRPC Client\n    participant Server as tRPC Server\n    participant DB as Prisma (Database)\n    participant R2 as Cloudflare R2\n    participant TTS as Chatterbox API\n    participant AudioAPI as /api/audio/[id]\n    Note over User,Form: 1. 用户填写表单并点击生成\n    User->>Form: 点击生成按钮\n    Form->>tRPC: mutateAsync({ text, voiceId, temperature, topP, topK, repetitionPenalty })\n    \n    Note over tRPC,Server: 2. tRPC 路由到 generations.create\n    tRPC->>Server: generations.create mutation\n    Server->>DB: prisma.voice.findUnique({ id: voiceId })\n    DB-->>Server: voice (包含 r2ObjectKey)\n    Note over Server,TTS: 3. 调用 TTS API 生成音频\n    Server->>TTS: POST /generate { prompt, voice_key, temperature, ... }\n    TTS-->>Server: ArrayBuffer (音频数据)\n    Note over Server,R2: 4. 保存到 R2 存储\n    Server->>DB: prisma.generation.create({ ... })\n    Server->>R2: uploadAudio({ buffer, key })\n    Server->>DB: prisma.generation.update({ r2ObjectKey })\n    Server-->>Form: 返回 { id: generationId }\n    Note over Form,User: 5. 跳转到详情页\n    Form->>User: router.push(`/text-to-speech/${id}`)\n    Note over User,AudioAPI: 6. 前端请求音频\n    User->>AudioAPI: GET /api/audio/[id]\n    AudioAPI->>DB: prisma.generation.findUnique({ id })\n    \n    DB-->>AudioAPI: generation (包含 r2ObjectKey)\n    \n    AudioAPI->>R2: getSignedAudioUrl(r2ObjectKey)\n    R2-->>AudioAPI: signedUrl\n    \n    AudioAPI->>R2: fetch(signedUrl)\n    R2-->>AudioAPI: audio stream\n    \n    AudioAPI-->>User: 返回音频 (Content-Type: audio/wav)\n```         ","x":-1040,"y":-1040,"width":2600,"height":1640},
		{"id":"88860f5a613b5172","type":"text","text":"``` mermaid\nsequenceDiagram\n    participant Form as 前端 Form 组件\n    participant Hook as useTRPC Hook\n    participant L as httpBatchLink\n    participant API as /api/trpc/[trpc]\n    participant Handler as fetchRequestHandler\n    participant Router as appRouter\n    participant Middleware as orgProcedure 中间件\n    participant Logic as generations.create\n\n    Note over Form, L: 1. 客户端调用\n    Form->>Hook: trpc.generations.create.mutateAsync({ text, voiceId, ... })\n    Hook->>L: 调用 tRPC Client\n\n    Note over L, API: 2. HTTP 请求\n    L->>API: POST /api/trpc/generations.create<br/>Body: { json: { text, voiceId, ... } }\n\n    Note over API, Handler: 3. API 路由处理\n    API->>Handler: fetchRequestHandler({ req, router, createContext })\n\n    Note over Handler, Router: 4. 路由匹配\n    Handler->>Router: 解析路径 \"generations.create\"\n    Router->>Router: 匹配到 generationsRouter.create\n\n    Note over Router, Middleware: 5. 中间件验证\n    Router->>Middleware: 执行 orgProcedure 中间件\n    Middleware->>Middleware: auth() 获取 userId, orgId\n\n    alt 验证通过\n        Middleware->>Logic: next({ ctx: { userId, orgId } })\n    else 验证失败\n        Middleware-->>Form: 抛出 TRPCError (UNAUTHORIZED/FORBIDDEN)\n    end\n\n    Note over Logic, Form: 6. 执行逻辑并返回\n    Logic->>Logic: 验证 voice → 调用 TTS API → 上传 R2 → 保存 DB\n    Logic-->>Form: 返回 { id: \"gen_xxx\" }\n\n    Note over Form: 7. 跳转页面\n    Form->>Form: router.push(`/text-to-speech/${data.id}`)\n```","x":4160,"y":-1320,"width":2760,"height":1520},
		{"id":"2dc4102b8aff9cf1","type":"text","text":"```mermaid\n\nerDiagram\n\n    Voice ||--o{ Generation : \"has\"\n\n    Voice {\n\n        string id PK\n\n        string orgId FK \"nullable for SYSTEM\"\n\n        string name\n\n        string description\n\n        VoiceCategory category\n\n        string language \"en-US, zh-CN...\"\n\n        VoiceVariant variant \"SYSTEM | CUSTOM\"\n\n        string r2ObjectKey \"audio file path in R2\"\n\n        datetime createdAt\n\n        datetime updatedAt\n\n    }\n\n  \n\n    Generation {\n\n        string id PK\n\n        string voiceId FK\n\n        string text \"input text\"\n\n        float temperature\n\n        float topP\n\n        int topK\n\n        float repetitionPenalty\n\n        string r2ObjectKey \"generated audio path\"\n\n        datetime createdAt\n\n    }\n\n  \n\n    Organization {\n\n        string id PK \"clerk orgId\"\n\n        string name\n\n        datetime createdAt\n\n    }\n\n  \n\n    Organization ||--o{ Voice : \"owns\"\n\n    Organization ||--o{ Generation : \"creates\"\n\n```","x":-2355,"y":-1320,"width":540,"height":960}
	],
	"edges":[
